cff-version: 1.2.0
title: OpenAgentsGym
message: If you use this harness or its results, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Schikarski
    given-names: Frank
repository-code: https://github.com/FrankPSch/OpenAgentsGym
abstract: >-
  A harness that treats the methodology an agent works under as the variable and
  everything else as constant. The same task is run under different sets of agent
  instructions and each run is scored on correctness, parsimony, cost and adherence.
keywords:
  - agents
  - llm
  - benchmark
  - evaluation
  - agent-instructions
license: MIT
